cff-version: 1.2.0
title: Quantum Practitioner Lab
message: >-
  If you use this software or its results, please cite it using the metadata
  below.
type: software
authors:
  - given-names: Jon
    family-names: B
    alias: iconbaypark2900
repository-code: "https://github.com/iconbaypark2900/quantum-practitioner-lab"
abstract: >-
  Runnable quantum algorithm tutorials for simulation, optimization, PDEs and
  quantum machine learning, built on Qiskit 2.x V2 primitives. Every method is
  measured against a classical baseline and the comparison is reported as it
  came out, including when the classical method wins. Results are cross-checked
  against an independently written PennyLane implementation and benchmarked
  under simulated device noise.
keywords:
  - quantum computing
  - qiskit
  - pennylane
  - variational quantum eigensolver
  - quantum approximate optimization algorithm
  - quantum machine learning
  - benchmarking
license: Apache-2.0
version: 0.3.0
date-released: "2026-08-30"
